    "body": "Hi, in general you are right. So, first of all, please take a look at `OneHotEncoder` from sklearn, I hope we can make use of it instead of implementing a conversion login from scratch. Next, I'm not sure we need `categorical_cols` right away, we have a basic classifier that does not accept different type of labels, so should be easy to derive a label type from true labels.\r\nAnyway, any suggestions are very welcome as some exploration is required here.\r\n",
