    "updated_at": "2021-06-29T14:48:35Z",
    "body": "On the top level, I think, we should keep interfaces as simple as possible and, by default, users should not bother of number of qubits and so on. And in the same time the interfaces should be flexible, so experienced users can tweak model in a way they want. Yeah, feel free to split the work into two or more PRs.",
